 14
Display the Last N rows from the employees table.
(Use Correlated Sub Queries)
====================================================================

SQL Command:
------------
-- Example: Display last 3 employees based on EMPNO

sql> SELECT E1.EMPNO, E1.ENAME
     FROM EMP E1
     WHERE 3 >
     (
         SELECT COUNT(*)
         FROM EMP E2
         WHERE E2.EMPNO > E1.EMPNO
     )
     ORDER BY EMPNO;

Output:
-------

EMPNO   ENAME
------  -------
7876    ADAMS
7902    FORD
7934    MILLER
